@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontColor #000000
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #000000
skinparam ComponentBorderColor #000000
skinparam ComponentFontColor #000000
skinparam RectangleBorderColor #000000
skinparam RectangleFontColor #000000

title GitHub PR Flow Before Bound-Issue Guarantee

actor "LLM / Agent" as Agent #E8F0FE
component "MCP Server\nGitHub Wrapper" as Wrapper #D9EAD3
component "GitHub REST API" as Api #FFE5E5
database "Repository" as Repo #EAF7EA

Agent --> Wrapper : github_create_pull_request_from_template
Wrapper --> Api : create PR with template body
Api --> Repo : PR created

note right of Wrapper #FFFDEB
Issue binding depends on caller body content.
PR can be created without a linked issue.
end note

@enduml

